## Code changes (2026-04-18) — gallery layouts

### Summary of what we did today

1. **Small-screen gallery (first iteration)** — turned the three portfolio strips into a vertical, scrollable layout on narrow viewports so thumbnails stacked instead of only scrolling sideways.

2. **Two-column gallery** — replaced the fixed bottom strip with a full-page, two-column masonry layout (CSS `columns` + `break-inside: avoid`) so images scroll down the page and use more of the screen, closer to Nahuel's reference.

